#showas:萨纳斯战争
As a Human Empire, you face two powerful AIs; one with Lovecraftian Horrors by its side, the other whose Bastion Planets are Nomadic.

You are joined by the Dark Zenith Svikari. You can also opt to directly control the Dark Zenith Svikari with "F4", but they will play normally if not under your control.